{"id":"cb582ee79087af80","group":"91","path":"91/91-thm-KF-soundness.md","title":"KF 对所有标准固定点经典闭包的可靠性","display":"thm-KF-soundness — KF 对所有标准固定点经典闭包的可靠性","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth","book_abbrev":"91","label":"91-thm-KF-soundness","aliases":["91-thm-KF-soundness","91-thm-KF-relative-soundness","91-thm-KF-consistent"],"display":"thm-KF-soundness — KF 对所有标准固定点经典闭包的可靠性","depends_on":["[[91-thm-KF-minimal-fixed-point-characterization]]","[[91-df-KF]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"91"},{"key":"label","html":"91-thm-KF-soundness"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>91-thm-KF-soundness</span><span>91-thm-KF-relative-soundness</span><span>91-thm-KF-consistent</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-KF-soundness — KF 对所有标准固定点经典闭包的可靠性"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"edf61bb893ee0ba7\" href=\"?note=edf61bb893ee0ba7\" title=\"91-thm-KF-minimal-fixed-point-characterization\">91-thm-KF-minimal-fixed-point-characterization</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"a0a2284f96eaea1d\" href=\"?note=a0a2284f96eaea1d\" title=\"91-df-KF\">91-df-KF</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{KF}\">\\(\\mathrm{KF}\\)</span> 为 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"a0a2284f96eaea1d\" href=\"?note=a0a2284f96eaea1d\" title=\"91-df-KF\">91-df-KF</a> 的经典公理系统；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\models_{\\mathrm{CL}}\">\\(\\models_{\\mathrm{CL}}\\)</span> 为经典满足关系，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T}\">\\(\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\subseteq C_T\">\\(X\\subseteq C_T\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"J(X)=X\">\\(J(X)=X\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak M_X^{\\mathrm{cl}}=(\\mathbb N,T\\mapsto X)\">\\(\\mathfrak M_X^{\\mathrm{cl}}=(\\mathbb N,T\\mapsto X)\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T}\">\\(\\sigma\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T}\\)</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}KF\\text{-}soundness}\\vdash\\quad\n\\mathrm{KF}\\vdash\\sigma\\quad\\Longrightarrow\\quad\\mathfrak M_X^{\\mathrm{cl}}\\models_{\\mathrm{CL}}\\sigma.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}KF\\text{-}soundness}\\vdash\\quad\n\\mathrm{KF}\\vdash\\sigma\\quad\\Longrightarrow\\quad\\mathfrak M_X^{\\mathrm{cl}}\\models_{\\mathrm{CL}}\\sigma.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{KF}\\vdash T(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner})\\quad\\Longrightarrow\\quad\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner\\in X.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{KF}\\vdash T(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner})\\quad\\Longrightarrow\\quad\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner\\in X.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>先由固定点模型刻画验证全部公理，再应用经典一阶逻辑可靠性。第二行把真理原子的经典满足展开为编码成员关系。\n第一行的外层满足不是强 Kleene 指定真值。只有句子外面明确再加 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span>，才能由可靠性取得其内部真信息；KF 的一般定理可在强 Kleene 模型中未定义。</p>\n<p>来源：Theorem 15.15 与经典一阶逻辑可靠性；§20.1–20.2 的内外逻辑讨论。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"91-thm-KF-minimal-fixed-point-characterization","status":"resolved","id":"edf61bb893ee0ba7","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-thm-KF-minimal-fixed-point-characterization]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-KF","status":"resolved","id":"a0a2284f96eaea1d","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-KF]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-KF","status":"resolved","id":"a0a2284f96eaea1d","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{KF}$ 为 [[91-df-KF]] 的经典公理系统；$\\models_{\\mathrm{CL}}$ 为经典满足关系，$\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T}$。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{KF}","display":false},{"tex":"\\models_{\\mathrm{CL}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T}","display":false},{"tex":"X\\subseteq C_T","display":false},{"tex":"J(X)=X","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathfrak M_X^{\\mathrm{cl}}=(\\mathbb N,T\\mapsto X)","display":false},{"tex":"\\sigma\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}KF\\text{-}soundness}\\vdash\\quad\n\\mathrm{KF}\\vdash\\sigma\\quad\\Longrightarrow\\quad\\mathfrak M_X^{\\mathrm{cl}}\\models_{\\mathrm{CL}}\\sigma.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{KF}\\vdash T(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner})\\quad\\Longrightarrow\\quad\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner\\in X.","display":true},{"tex":"T","display":false}],"bytes":1515,"backlinks":[{"id":"4278731e7fc892de","anchor":"ref-139","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[91-thm-KF-soundness]]"},{"id":"e93fc3e2f8fd50d4","anchor":"ref-130","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[91-thm-CT-conservative.md]]\n[[91-thm-FS-consistency.md]]\n[[91-thm-FS-necessity-adequacy.md]]\n[[91-thm-FS-omega-consistency.md]]\n[[91-thm-FS-strength.md]]\n[[91-thm-KF-consistency.md]]\n[[91-thm-KF-minimal-fixed-point-characterization.md]]\n[[91-thm-KF-proves-PA-consistency.md]]\n[[91-thm-KF-soundness.md]]\n[[91-thm-McGee.md]]\n[[91-thm-T-schema-consistency.md]]\n[[91-thm-T-schema-partial-recovery.md]]\n[[91-thm-TB-completeness.md]]\n[[91-thm-Tarski-undefinability.md]]\n[[91-thm-VF-KF-equivalence.md]]\n[[91-thm-VF-conservative.md]]\n[[91-thm-compositional-completeness.md]]\n[[91-thm-conservative-extension-axioms.md]]\n[[91-thm-diagonal-lemma.md]]\n[[91-thm-fixed-point-existence.md]]\n[[91-thm-fixed-point-lattice.md]]\n[[91-thm-fixed-point-non-uniqueness.md]]\n[[91-thm-hierarchical-truth-consistency.md]]\n[[91-thm-iteration-convergence.md]]\n[[91-thm-kripke-jump-iteration.md]]\n[[91-thm-liar-not-provable.md]]\n[[91-thm-liar-sentence-properties.md]]\n[[91-thm-numeral-adequacy.md]]\n[[91-thm-positive-induction-adequacy.md]]\n[[91-thm-reflection-from-truth.md]]\n[[91-thm-revision-convergence.md]]\n[[91-thm-soundness-equivalence.md]]\n[[91-thm-stable-sentence-characterization.md]]\n[[91-thm-truth-induction-adequacy.md]]\n[[91-thm-truth-iteration-stability.md]]\n[[91-thm-truth-predicate-definability-hierarchy.md]]\n[[91-thm-truth-predicate-non-creativity.md]]\n[[91-thm-truth-predicate-stronger-than-provability.md]]\n[[91-thm-typed-conservative.md]]\n[[91-thm-untyped-nonconservative.md]]"}],"outgoing":["edf61bb893ee0ba7","a0a2284f96eaea1d"]}